        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_21cc9daf9e474b769ec8d5e135228b55",
      "statement": "Because Spotify's label: search filter matches fuzzily, ReleasePoller verifies every candidate album against its full album object (GET /albums/{id}, one GET per candidate): only albums whose real Spotify label (label field, or a normalized copyrights line when absent) exactly equals the followed label's name (case-insensitive, trimmed) are upserted with the real label as stored attribution; a positively verified mismatch removes any existing label_albums link (self-heal), and an unverifiable candidate is skipped until the next cycle.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/Polling/ReleasePoller.cs#L209-L245",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31b7d7a422005ac1e0fe23e6ad3643324fed7848419e4de1c2f6f30b33c9a909:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/Polling/ReleasePoller.cs#L500-L540",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:099116a622a9f462fc78dc8e1376b31276377f91c6072cdb69cdbb6619ae6111:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4dc3cd8f005a443e810de4addc1b42f2",
      "statement": "Discovered releases persist through the label_albums junction table (migration AddLabelAlbumsJunction, composite PK (label_id, album_id), cascade deletes, first_seen_at_utc/last_confirmed_at_utc): the link insert is a single atomic INSERT ... SELECT ... FROM labels WHERE trim(lower(name)) = trim(lower(@spotifyLabel)) FOR KEY SHARE that re-reads the label's committed current name under a row lock, so a poll pass carrying a pre-rename snapshot can never link or resurrect a mismatched album; GET /api/labels/{labelId}/releases reads releases exclusively through this junction, and the only deletion paths are a verified real-label mismatch and the rename-time audit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/GetLabelReleases.cs#L15-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:463c373d5ef857da3e3ea932f2e1632dbaa70ec17438adc127f9fa47a68e343e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/Polling/ReleasePoller.cs#L450-L475",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a7a72e4b2b0342fe207d56c8f9dea6288bf649e3dcec2a37cfa092a900cb51cf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Infrastructure/Migrations/20260928233935_AddLabelAlbumsJunction.cs#L14-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8e6967e6e4c34bddabc3776e04f1ec2b333db7cc08846b8201dd8e904e500c07:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f88411e9aa7d461b97746871c3aa01ab",
      "statement": "Renaming a label runs ReleasePoller.AuditLabelLinksAsync inside the same transaction: every existing label_albums link is re-verified via GET /albums/{id}, verified mismatches and Spotify-404 albums are unlinked, exact matches are re-upserted with corrected attribution, and any unverifiable link aborts the audit with LabelLinkAuditIncompleteException so the whole rename rolls back (HTTP 503) and nothing unverified stays listed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Labels/UpdateLabel.cs#L49-L89",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8e714e004527581c6f75697e44ac9e222b691186cb379c9ed552d139bf8385a4:"
