    {
      "id": "claim_83f08d8ef1b141619c1b4bb0fe0534fa",
      "statement": "The Spotify integration uses a client-credentials app token (no user OAuth): a singleton SpotifyTokenProvider caches and serializes token exchange, a SpotifyTokenHandler attaches the Bearer token, and the typed ISpotifyApiClient runs a custom Polly pipeline TotalTimeout (300 s) -> Retry (3 attempts, exponential, honours Retry-After on 429) -> CircuitBreaker -> AttemptTimeout (15 s); standard resilience defaults are deliberately avoided because Spotify 429 Retry-After values can exceed the default total timeout.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Setup/SpotifyOptions.cs#L8-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d14786c8946746492e3ec05a11994088191f0ba649f873817158bf4b573c7f9:"
        },
